undary-vs-reality-check"},{"from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.trauma-detection-standard","id":"notes.psychology.trauma-detection-standard","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":11,"offset":1294},"end":{"line":21,"column":57,"offset":1340},"indent":[]},"value":"notes.psychology.boundary-vs-reality-check"},{"from":{"fname":"notes.psychology.vulnerable-narcissism-vs-growth","id":"notes.psychology.vulnerable-narcissism-vs-growth","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":26,"column":53,"offset":1759},"end":{"line":26,"column":99,"offset":1805},"indent":[]},"value":"notes.psychology.boundary-vs-reality-check"},{"from":{"fname":"zettel.psychology.npd-ecosystem","id":"zettel.psychology.npd-ecosystem","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":16,"column":133,"offset":1044},"end":{"line":16,"column":188,"offset":1099},"indent":[]},"value":"notes.psychology.boundary-vs-reality-check"},{"from":{"fname":"zettel.psychology.npd-ecosystem","id":"zettel.psychology.npd-ecosystem","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":120,"offset":1221},"end":{"line":17,"column":180,"offset":1281},"indent":[]},"value":"notes.psychology.boundary-vs-reality-check"},{"from":{"fname":"zettel.psychology.npd-ecosystem","id":"zettel.psychology.npd-ecosystem","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":28,"column":3,"offset":1933},"end":{"line":28,"column":49,"offset":1979},"indent":[]},"value":"notes.psychology.boundary-vs-reality-check"}],"anchors":{"boundary-vs-reality-check":{"type":"header","text":"Boundary vs Reality Check","value":"boundary-vs-reality-check","line":13,"column":0,"depth":1},"overview":{"type":"header","text":"Overview","value":"overview","line":15,"column":0,"depth":2},"1-boundary-batas-diri":{"type":"header","text":"1. Boundary (Batas Diri)","value":"1-boundary-batas-diri","line":18,"column":0,"depth":2},"2-reality-check-uji-realita":{"type":"header","text":"2. Reality Check (Uji Realita)","value":"2-reality-check-uji-realita","line":26,"column":0,"depth":2},"synthesis":{"type":"header","text":"Synthesis","value":"synthesis","line":34,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":[],"parent":"k7whujrtxo2tvftwjvbq1jh","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"boundary-vs-reality-check\">Boundary vs Reality Check<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#boundary-vs-reality-check\"></a></h1>\n<h1 id=\"boundary-vs-reality-check-1\">Boundary vs Reality Check<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#boundary-vs-reality-check-1\"></a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"overview\">Overview<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#overview\"></a></h2>\n<p>Untuk menghindari menjadi korban eksploitasi (seperti dalam pola NPD) atau menjadi pelaku, manusia membutuhkan dua mekanisme kontrol: satu di level relasi dan satu di level kognitif.</p>\n<h2 id=\"1-boundary-batas-diri\">1. Boundary (Batas Diri)<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#1-boundary-batas-diri\"></a></h2>\n<p><strong>Level: Relasi</strong>\nBoundary adalah filter yang menentukan \"mana yang boleh masuk ke hidup gue?\".</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Fungsi</strong>: Mencegah empati berubah menjadi pintu masuk eksploitasi.</li>\n<li><strong>Risiko</strong>: Tanpa boundary, seseorang cenderung melakukan <em>self-sacrifice</em> yang tidak sehat.</li>\n<li><strong>Konteks Budaya</strong>: Di Indonesia, budaya \"nggak enakan\" seringkali mengikis boundary, sehingga menciptakan ruang bagi perilaku eksploitatif untuk tumbuh.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"2-reality-check-uji-realita\">2. Reality Check (Uji Realita)<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#2-reality-check-uji-realita\"></a></h2>\n<p><strong>Level: Kognitif</strong>\nReality check adalah proses verifikasi \"apakah pikiran gue sesuai dengan kenyataan?\".</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Fungsi</strong>: Mencegah ambisi berubah menjadi fantasi.</li>\n<li><strong>Risiko</strong>: Tanpa reality check, seseorang bisa terjebak dalam <em>grandiosity</em> atau merasa diakui hanya melalui validasi semu (misal: jumlah like di media sosial).</li>\n<li><strong>Konteks Digital</strong>: Arsitektur media sosial seringkali memotong proses reality check karena memberikan validasi instan tanpa konsekuensi interpersonal yang nyata.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"synthesis\">Synthesis<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#synthesis\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Boundary</strong> menjaga agar kita tidak dieksploitasi orang lain.</li>\n<li><strong>Reality Check</strong> menjaga agar kita tidak mengeksploitasi orang lain (atau menipu diri sendiri).</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Jika keduanya kuat, seseorang bisa tetap ambisius dan percaya diri tanpa harus merusak ekosistem sosialnya.</p>\n<p>See also: <a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.psychology.npd-definition\">Narcissistic Personality Disorder (NPD) as an Exploitation System</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">psychology (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">boundary (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">cognitive-health (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<strong>Backlinks</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.productivity.idea-ownership-public\">Idea Ownership and Public Contribution</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.psychology.trauma-detection-standard\">Trauma and the Lowering of Danger Detection Standards</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.psychology.vulnerable-narcissism-vs-growth\">Vulnerable Narcissism vs Growth Patterns</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.psychology.npd-ecosystem\">NPD as a Social Ecosystem Disruptor</a></li>\n</ul>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"header","text":"Find More","value":"find-more","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":["book-summaries","daily","handbook","notes","tags","til","zettel"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nWelcome to the homepage! I use Dendron to store and organize notes, ideas, and experiments I’m working on. Here are the main sections you’ll find on this site:\n\n1. **Learning Notes** — Practical notes on programming, recent technologies, and productivity tips.\n2. **Personal Projects** — Summaries of projects, experiments, and outcomes I’m working on or have completed.\n3. **Writings & Opinions** — Casual articles and reflections about technology, daily life, and other interesting topics.\n\nI’m constantly experimenting and learning. I hope the content here helps you as a reference, a starting point for discussion, or just light reading.\n\n> Why Dendron?\n>\nDendron helps keep notes organized. Its \"seed\" and \"vault\" concepts make it easy to structure content and find what you need.\n\n## Find More\n\nIf you want to learn more or connect, check these links:\n\n- [Homepage (Dendron)](https://zeihanaulia.github.io/sotoy/)\n- [My GitHub](https://github.com/zeihanaulia)\n- [My Twitter / X](https://x.c